+# Wire format
+
+The project's recorded decisions (`docs/format.md`, `design/ENGINE.md`) specify
+formats for on-disk storage and portable projection — SQLite as the operational
+store, Markdown with frontmatter as the human-readable projection, and JSONL for
+`muninn export`/`muninn import` — but none of them names a wire serialisation
+format for data transmitted between processes or over a network. Nothing current
+is recorded on this question.
